s a damaged enemy creature, it gains +2 STR for that combat.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":4,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-024","name":"Ravine Stalker","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/5","rules":"Bloodied - When Ravine Stalker attacks a damaged enemy creature, it does not take retaliation damage from that combat.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":5,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-025","name":"Pale Moon Tyrant","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"6/8","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round another friendly Moondemon becomes Bloodied, that creature gains +2 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":6,"hp":8,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-026","name":"Vespera, Redfang Matriarch","type":"Legendary Creature","cost":9,"resource":2,"statsText":"8/11","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round Vespera deals damage, you may redirect up to 2 HP of her universal restore to another friendly Moondemon. BLOODTHIRST - The Pack Drinks Together: the first Moondemon destroyed by Bloodthirst each round gives +3 STR / +3 maximum and current HP to every other friendly Moondemon instead of +2/+2. FRENZIED - Redline: the first time each round a Bloodied friendly Moondemon would return to full HP and be destroyed by Frenzied, deal 1 damage to it before the full-HP death check.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":8,"hp":11,"legendary":true},{"id":"MON-027","name":"Blood Price","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Lose 2 Health. Gain 3 resources this round. Bloodied - If you control a Bloodied Moondemon, one Bloodied friendly Moondemon gains +2 STR this round.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-028","name":"Pack Feeding","type":"Spell","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Restore 2 HP to up to three friendly Moondemons. Bloodied - For each Bloodied target, you may replace 1 of that healing with +1 maximum HP permanently without restoring that point.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-029","name":"Moonrage","type":"Spell","cost":6,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Bloodied - All Bloodied friendly Moondemons gain +2 STR this round. After each of those creatures takes a combat action, deal 1 damage to it.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"},{"id":"MON-030","name":"Predator's Reprisal","type":"Trap","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"When an enemy creature destroys one of your creatures, Bloodied - Choose another Bloodied friendly Moondemon. If it has not acted this round, it may immediately attack that enemy. After the attack, deal 1 damage to it.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON"}],"Eliteborn":[{"id":"ELI-001","name":"Page of the Line","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":1,"statsText":"1/3","rules":"Formation (1) - Page of the Line has +2 STR.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":1,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-002","name":"Banner Squire","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"1/4","rules":"Formation (2) - The other creature in this Formation has +0 STR / +1 maximum and current HP.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":1,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-003","name":"Twinblade Cadet","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/3","rules":"Formation (2) - Twinblade Cadet has +2 STR / +1 maximum and current HP.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":2,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-004","name":"Oathguard","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"3/5","rules":"Formation (3) - Oathguard has Taunt and +1 STR.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":3,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-005","name":"Bastion Captain","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"2/6","rules":"Formation (4) - The first damage dealt to a creature in this Formation each round is reduced by 2 before any Disperse split.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":2,"hp":6,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-006","name":"Formation Adept","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"3/4","rules":"Formation (3) - Formation Adept has +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP. The first time its Formation becomes exactly 3, draw 1 card, then put 1 card from your hand on the bottom of your deck.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":3,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-007","name":"Relay Knight","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/5","rules":"Formation (2) - The first time each round an Equip attached to a creature in this Formation grants a stat bonus or triggered effect, the other creature gains +1 STR this round.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":4,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-008","name":"Bondwarden","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/7","rules":"Formation (4) - At the start of your round, restore 2 HP divided among creatures in this Formation.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":3,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-009","name":"Standard Marshal","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/7","rules":"Formation (5) - Other creatures in this Formation have +1 STR.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":4,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-010","name":"Crowned Intercessor","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/8","rules":"Formation (3) - Once per round, when another creature in this Formation is targeted by an attack, Crowned Intercessor may become the target instead.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":4,"hp":8,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-011","name":"United Colossus","type":"Creature","cost":8,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/9","rules":"Formation (5+) - United Colossus has +1 STR for each other creature in this Formation, maximum +4 STR.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":5,"hp":9,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-012","name":"First Among Equals","type":"Creature","cost":9,"resource":1,"statsText":"6/9","rules":"Formation (1) - First Among Equals has +3 STR / +3 maximum and current 